(text (at 20.32 17.78 0)
	(effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left top))
	(uuid "a66cc5b2-a9ab-4720-966e-b3dcb403ddc0")
	"PURPOSE: PCIe reference clock (OCP PE_REFCLKp/n) and reset distribution.\nOCP: OCP Accelerator Module Design Specification v1.5 Table 4 OAM Pinouts — PE_REFCLK 100 MHz PCIe Gen5 compliant.\nCLOCK TREE: Y1 oscillator → U1 PCIe buffer → OAM PE_REFCLKp/n (+ host fanout).\nALT: Host REFCLK passthrough via J1 (Mode B) — select after REFCLK guide.\nRESET: PERST# (OCP) via U2; WARMRST#/AUX_100M/PERST_Conn1 — TODO blocks NC.\nAMD: Reset release vs OAM_PG, SSC, dual-GCD clocks — TODO (not invented)."
)
(text (at 20.32 88.0 0)
	(effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left top))
	(uuid "bf99aeb5-e84b-4736-a886-f6006f8ef660")
	"OCP Table 4 OAM Pinouts: PE_REFCLKp + PE_REFCLKn — official OAM naming (not REFCLK or PE_REFCLK aggregate)."
)
